Z||000004||dogtired||12-20-1999||03:45 AM||||Those are good readings   BUT    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif"><BR>I will bet they are from the trunk side. The firewall side is harder to check and the #no 5 and 6 hole is usually where the normal wear will show up because of the recall and the Airfilter. Good readings, but I would look at the rest of the stoy, before drawing any conclusions??   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>My Opinions, Just Me, GOOD LUCK.||||reg||6
